<p>A fire tore through a coastal settlement in Sandakan district in Malaysia&#x27;s Sabah state early Sunday, destroying about 1,000 homes in a tightly packed village of wooden stilt houses and displacing more than 9,000 people. The settlement, known as a &quot;water village,&quot; sits on the island of Borneo and is home to vulnerable residents, including indigenous and stateless communities, making the loss especially severe for people with few resources to rebuild. Survivors moved into temporary shelters after the overnight blaze reduced much of the community to ash. Coverage has focused on the scale of the destruction rather than confirmed casualties, but emergency crews and newly opened shelters offered an immediate lifeline.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/qs-uI7YADH-_d1Dn6G-N6IX6H9qMDxTppiDS3zslEEchSNBEC5t9CYaQgUza8EqFG7NEu85UNLAVXRVqdFPjr-El9SXjwhItTQSdhUNVvBtjEI3TJq0gJy8hN9Er3ZJcXNF49xEAPhITCXtl3E1vQw0Z9N_OS5VOlFabrIHKz478u6zr8027BoKYqpbAoE3SOSh6F8LyAsLcVA' alt='A view of Kampung Bahagia, on the island of Borneo in Malaysia, in a handout photo taken and released by Malaysia’s Sandakan Fire and Rescue Department on Sunday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Informal construction: The Guardian said many of the destroyed dwellings were makeshift homes, underscoring the settlement&#x27;s informal, resource-poor character.</li><li>Overnight destruction: The New York Times reported that most of the community was reduced to ash overnight, showing how quickly the fire overwhelmed the settlement.</li><li>Broadcast evidence: Drone footage and handout images showed a broad swath of the coastal settlement burned out, giving a clearer sense of the fire&#x27;s reach than ground-level accounts alone.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Sandakan Fire and Rescue Department: Through official handout images cited in coverage, the department helped show the scale of destruction across the stilt settlement. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/19/world/asia/coastal-village-fire-borneo-malaysia.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>Malaysian authorities: Once the scale of homelessness became clear, officials shifted from emergency response to coordinating relief for residents who could not return home. (<a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/fire-destroys-1000-homes-malaysian-coastal-village-borneo-132194423'>ABC News</a>)</li><li>International media coverage: The Guardian framed the fire as a disaster hitting an impoverished coastal community with many informal homes, not just as a story of property loss. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/20/fire-destroys-1000-stilt-homes-in-malaysias-sabah-displacing-thousands'>The Guardian</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c4gjk99vp87o'>Drone footage shows huge Malaysian coastal village fire</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/19/world/asia/coastal-village-fire-borneo-malaysia.html'>Fire Destroys Most of Coastal Village in Malaysia</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/20/fire-destroys-1000-stilt-homes-in-malaysias-sabah-displacing-thousands'>Fire destroys 1,000 ‘stilt’ homes in Malaysia’s Sabah, displacing thousands</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/fire-destroys-1000-homes-malaysian-coastal-village-borneo-132194423'>Fire destroys 1,000 homes in a Malaysian coastal village on Borneo Island</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/video/2026/04/20/major-fire-in-malaysia-destroys-hundreds-of-homes-displaces-thousands'>Major fire in Malaysia destroys hundreds of homes, displaces thousands</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://gulfnews.com/world/asia/fire-razes-1000-stilt-homes-in-malaysias-sabah-thousands-displaced-1.500511963'>A fire destroys about 1,000 homes in a stilt settlement in Sandakan, Sabah, Malaysia, displacing thousands of residents.</a> - gulfnews.com</li></ul